{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31751","headline":"寄丘儒 · 贾岛","name":"寄丘儒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地近轻数见，地远重一面。\n一面如何重，重甚珍宝片。\n自经失欢笑，几度腾霜霰。\n此心镇悬悬，天象固回转。\n长安秋风高，子在东甸县。\n仪形信寂蔑，风雨岂乖间。\n凭人报消息，何易凭笔砚。\n俱不尽我心，终须对君宴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}